  <header class="page-hero shell"><p class="section-label">About / Ilian Aigner</p><h1>Curious<br />by nature.</h1><p>Good questions have taken me from Hamburg to Delaware, and from classroom ideas to building STRK.</p></header>
  <section class="content-section shell about-intro"><img class="about-portrait" src="/assets/images/ilian-portrait-700.jpg" width="700" height="700" alt="Portrait of Ilian Aigner" loading="lazy" /><div><p>I’m an entrepreneurship student at the University of Delaware, working toward a B.S. with minors in Professional Sales &amp; Sales Management and Marketing. I expect to graduate in Fall 2028.</p><p>I’m especially interested in B2B sales because it rewards preparation, careful listening, and the ability to make a complex next step feel clear. At STRK, I’ve been able to connect customer discovery with positioning and product thinking.</p><p>Before that, coaching basketball in Hamburg taught me to adjust my communication to different people and help a team progress over time. Travel and working across German, English, and French keep broadening my perspective.</p><p>I’m seeking a U.S. B2B sales, SDR, or BDR internship where I can learn quickly and contribute early.</p><a class="button button-primary" href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
